{"id":"n62881-3-6","stage":2,"title":"양 · 食量","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62881-3-6-1","ko":"뷔페에서 너무 폭식을 했어.","zh":"在自助餐上吃得太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뷔페에서","meaning":"自助餐","explanation":"뷔페：自助餐；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"뷔페","audio":"/audio/6d0e2a824abd9d8a9048.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61014","senseId":"1","lemma":"뷔페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뷔페에서","audio":"/audio/fb43d413de1c30bb2ef1.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"폭식을","meaning":"暴食","explanation":"폭식：暴食；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"폭식","audio":"/audio/076cd19972352c0be116.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83502","senseId":"1","lemma":"폭식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭식을","audio":"/audio/3262fb142821df7d5f26.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d0e2a824abd9d8a","term":"뷔페","zh":"自助餐","audio":"/audio/6d0e2a824abd9d8a9048.mp3","entryId":"61014","definition":"摆放有多种饮食以供客人自己选择来享用的餐厅。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"076cd19972352c0b","term":"폭식","zh":"暴食","audio":"/audio/076cd19972352c0be116.mp3","entryId":"83502","definition":"一下子吃过多的食物。","pronunciation":["폭씩"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","te